
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Before you agree to one more thing next year, take a look at what you&#8217;ve already agreed to.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That&#8217;s one reason I keep a <a href="https://www.neuyear.net/products/focused">Focused wall calendar where I can see it</a>. A trip, a deadline, and a busy stretch at work can look perfectly manageable when you consider them separately. Put them on the same calendar and you may see a different picture.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The whole year is there at once. There are no gaps between months, so a project that runs from February into March stays connected. You can see where things overlap and where you still have room.</p>



